              "value": "1) List of Payment Process Request templates: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_CODE_NER_FOR_PPR_TEMPLATE_PARSER.$output.result}} \n2) Template mentioned in user message: {{$context.$variables.pprTemplate}} \n\nYour responsibility is to format the output to be shown to the user.\n\nInform the user that multiple payment process request template was identified based on user message and template (show the template name mentioned in user message). List all PPRs found and tell user to choose one. \n- When listing the Payment Process Requests, only list the name, and ignore other attributes like id and score.\n\nStrictly follow the JSON output format like below:\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"<Your concise content to let user choose one Payment Process Request template from the following>\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"list\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"<List all Payment Process Request templates you found>\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 2\n  }\n]"
