          "id": "1768508956485",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1768508956487_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Output: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_BO_INITIATE_PPR_SCHEDULE_REQUEST.$output}} \n\nIf the output is not empty and has a value in \"id\" attribute, tell user the payment process request run has been successfully scheduled. And use a human-friendly language to show the PPR details to user. Details are in the following:\n1. Schedule Type: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_SCHEDULE_CONTEXT_EXTRACTOR.$output.scheduleType}}\n2. Payment Process Request Template: {{$context.$variables.pprTemplate}}\n3. Start Time: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_CHECK_SCHEDULE_CONFIGURATIONS.$output.startTimeISO}}\n4. End Time: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_CHECK_SCHEDULE_CONFIGURATIONS.$output.endTimeISO}}, if endTime is empty or Schedule Type is one-time, ignore endTime and do not mention it to user\n5. Frequency: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_CHECK_SCHEDULE_CONFIGURATIONS.$output.frequencyIcal}}, if frequency is empty or Schedule Type is one-time, ignore frequency and do not mention it to user\n6. Submit Payables Selected Installments Report: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_LLM_CHECK_SCHEDULE_CONFIGURATIONS.$output.submitReport}} \n7. Request ID: {{$context.$nodes.FIN_AP_CODE_GET_REQUEST_ID.$output.result}} \n\n\n\nGuardrails:\n1. Do not mention anything else that is not listed above.\n2. Keep your response concise, professional, human-friendly and polite.\n3. Start Time and End Time (if provided) must be non-empty strings in ISO 8601 UTC format (YYYY-MM-DDTHH:MM:SSZ).\n4. For RRULE syntax (FREQ=, BYDAY=, BYHOUR=...) in Frequency, you should present it in a human-readable text in final response. When presenting Frequency, use the below wording rules:\n  - If the schedule repeats every week, say: \"Weekly, on <day or days>\"\n  - If the schedule repeats every N weeks and N is greater than 1, say: \"Every N weeks on <day or days>\"\n  - If the schedule repeats every day, say: \"Daily\"\n  - If the schedule repeats every N days and N is greater than 1, say: \"Every N days\"\n  - If the schedule repeats every month, say: \"Monthly\" or \"Monthly, on day <date>\" when a day of month is present\n  - If the schedule repeats every N months and N is greater than 1, say: \"Every N months\" or \"Every N months on day <date>\"\n  - Never combine both styles in one phrase. Do not say \"Weekly, every 2 weeks on Monday\" or \"Weekly, every 4 weeks on Thursday\"\n  - Do not use shorthand labels such as \"Biweekly\". Prefer explicit wording like \"Every 2 weeks on Monday\"\n\nStrictly follow the JSON output format like below:\n1. For recurring schedule\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"<Your content to let user know the Payment Process Request schedule is successful, and check the following table for details.>\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"table\",\n    \"columnOrder\": [\"Request ID\", \"Schedule Type\", \"Payment Process Request Template\", \"Start Time\", \"End Time\", \"Frequency\", \"Submit Payables Selected Installments Report\"],\n    \"heading\": \"Payment Process Request Schedule Configurations\",\n    \"content\": [\n      {\n        \"Request ID\": 45312,\n        \"Schedule Type\": \"Recurring\",\n        \"Payment Process Request Template\": \"CPPRT_020015\",\n        \"Start Time\": \"2025-02-12T00:00:00Z\",\n        \"End Time\": \"2026-02-11T00:00:00Z\",\n        \"Frequency\": \"Weekly, on Tuesday\",\n        \"Submit Payables Selected Installments Report\": \"Y\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 2\n  }\n]\n\n2. For one-time schedule\n[\n  {\n    \"type\": \"text\",\n    \"content\": [\n      \"<Your content to let user know the Payment Process Request schedule is successful, and check the following table for details.>\"\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 1\n  },\n  {\n    \"type\": \"table\",\n    \"columnOrder\": [\"Request ID\", \"Schedule Type\", \"Payment Process Request Template\", \"Start Time\", \"Submit Payables Selected Installments Report\"],\n    \"heading\": \"Payment Process Request Schedule Configurations\",\n    \"content\": [\n      {\n        \"Request ID\": 45312,\n        \"Schedule Type\": \"One-time\",\n        \"Payment Process Request Template\": \"CPPRT_020015\",\n        \"Start Time\": \"2025-02-12T00:00:00Z\",\n        \"Submit Payables Selected Installments Report\": \"Y\"\n      }\n    ],\n    \"sequence\": 2\n  }\n]"
            }
          ],
